    "Default to 443/80/53 for reverse shells first",
    "Bind shell: target listens; you connect (bypasses outbound filter)",
    "Privesc exploits need callback—use same allowed port",
    "msfvenom LPORT=443 or LPORT=80 when 4444 fails",
    "socat/ncat bind: -lvp 443 -e cmd.exe"
  ],

